        "line": 77
      },
      {
        "text": "A5 — CORS misconfiguration fails silently in production `[C2]`",
        "line": 91
      },
      {
        "text": "A6 — CSV formula injection `[C2, verify]`",
        "line": 104
      },
      {
        "text": "B. Documentation drift",
