      },
      {
        "text": "B2 — Three model ids are accepted but unimplementable `[C2]`",
        "line": 149
      },
      {
        "text": "C. Reliability & operations",
        "line": 165
      },
      {
        "text": "C1 — `/healthz` is a stub `[C1]`",
        "line": 167
      },
      {
        "text": "C2 — Solve jobs orphaned on restart `[C1]`",
        "line": 183
      },
      {
        "text": "C3 — Cache failures are invisible `[C2]`",
        "line": 200
